buffer and record MAJOR-MODE/MODE-NAME.  Minimal per Doc 204 §3 P5: no
keymap, no font-lock, no `emacs-lisp-mode-hook' run -- nothing through
P5's own real consumers (`nl-parens', `nelisp-dev-source',
